کاربرد: dsconf [\-v] [\-j] instance logging error set compress\-enabled [\-h]

.SH "دستور (COMMAND)" \fI\,'dsconf logging error set compress\-disabled'\/\fR
کاربرد: dsconf [\-v] [\-j] instance logging error set compress\-disabled [\-h]

.SH "دستور (COMMAND)" \fI\,'dsconf logging error set buffering\-enabled'\/\fR
کاربرد: dsconf [\-v] [\-j] instance logging error set buffering\-enabled [\-h]

.SH "دستور (COMMAND)" \fI\,'dsconf logging error set buffering\-disabled'\/\fR
کاربرد: dsconf [\-v] [\-j] instance logging error set buffering\-disabled [\-h]

.SH "دستور (COMMAND)" \fI\,'dsconf logging error set max\-logs'\/\fR
